I approved Engineer 1's README change (commit bd50bd2) with no findings.

The change touches only `README.md`, plus the session record in `.ferrivide/history`. It adds a Settings section covering right-click to open and close the popup, the colour temperature slider, the custom schedule, and a pointer to Auto. It also adds a "Not verified on a live COSMIC session" list. The existing Auto section is kept as it was.

I checked the concrete claims against `src/`, and they match:
- the 1900–6500 K range and 100 K step;
- the 3500 K default;
- the four hint bands;
- the 21:00 and 07:00 defaults;
- the 20-second schedule tick;
- the midnight-crossing window;
- the right-click toggle.

The wording is "A panel applet for COSMIC", and no "COSMIC panel applet" remains. The change has no code edits, so I didn't run the build or tests.
